    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG4_U05_L04_Q01</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG4.V.03</p><p><strong>Passage:</strong> The board approved an interim plan until the permanent policy was complete. What does interim mean?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
